      <activity id="47bfa299-7256-564a-b034-85605832fcfa" activityNameId="190b1273-6892-5b65-aee0-e92e032dd21b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Olive pomace, burned in boiler furnace, at oil mill</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Olive pomace, burned in boiler furnace, at oil mill
Air emission from combustion data  completed with ecoinvent inventory of "logs, mixed, burned in wood heater 6kW";
UUID: f96ce8a4-3fcd-34cb-9e57-3297e1b66cde
This data set describes the emission into air caused by the combustion, infrastructure, fuel input and transport are included
Location: The inventory is modelled for a typical production area for olives in the Lythrodontas region in Cyprus.
Technology: Boiler Furnace
Time period: Collection of data and publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: Several air emissions estimated with data for wood combustion.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f96ce8a4-3fcd-34cb-9e57-3297e1b66cde.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
